cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the CourtStyle paper."
title: "CourtStyle: Unified Self-Supervised Framework for Tennis Playing Style Discovery"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of CourtStyle, a unified self-supervised framework for
  discovering recurring serve and rally styles from structured tennis match
  records and translating the discovered profiles into natural-language
  descriptions for practitioners.
